cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Awesome Data-Centric Recursive Self-Improvement
message: >-
  If you use this list or its machine-readable exports, please cite it.
type: dataset
abstract: >-
  A curated, machine-checked survey of systems that improve themselves by
  improving their own data, labelled along six dimensions: loop stage,
  improvement signal, recursion depth, improved artefact, domain and
  contribution type.
authors:
  - name: Awesome Data-Centric RSI contributors
repository-code: https://github.com/xubinrui/Awesome-Data-Centric-RSI
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - recursive self-improvement
  - data-centric AI
  - synthetic data
  - self-training
  - open-endedness
